leted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.3.stable.mono.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nApple M1 Pro, Sequoia 15.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nhint_range with a non literal value produce the error:  `Expected an integer constant after!.`\n\nhint_range works with floats but does not work with constants, so the error should most likely be `Expected a literal after`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn any shader, add a line:\n\n```glsl\nuniform float foo : hint_range(1.1, PI) = 0.0;\n```\nHowever if you just specify a float, it compiles with no errors:\n\n```glsl\nuniform float foo : hint_range(1.1, 2.2) = 0.0;\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIt is easily reproducible. Let me know if it is absolutely necessery.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101926/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timelin